Local deviations from upstream:
- portable/microchip/sam3x/{dcd,hcd}_sam3x.c: SAM3X UOTGHS port (upstream has
  no SAM3X driver) + tusb_option.h/tusb_mcu.h OPT_MCU_SAM3X entries.
  Arduino glue: src/ArduinoTinyUSB/bsp_due.cpp (clocks from libsam).
- portable/microchip/samd/hcd_samd.c: SETUP-token fix (is_setup), ERRORFLOW
  NAK resume, hcd_edpt_close, SW data-toggle quirk. None upstream.
- class/cdc/cdc_host.c make_new_itf(): default line coding 8N1 {9600,0,0,8}
  (a zero data_bits is silently rejected by the PL2303 driver).
- class/msc/msc_host.c: bounded TUR/sense retries (5), per-LUN TUR+capacity
  walk clamped to CFG_TUH_MSC_MAXLUN, mount fires when all LUNs are done
  (even zero ready, for hot-insert+rescan); app READ_CAPACITY refreshes
  capacity[lun]. Upstream probes only LUN 0 and retries unbounded.
- class/msc/msc_host.c tuh_msc_scsi_command(): reject unless stage IDLE
  (overlapping CBWs corrupt the in-flight command).
- host/usbh.c: PRINTER host driver table entry (still absent upstream;
  AUDIO entry + tusb.h include + CFG_TUH_AUDIO default are upstream as of
  this commit), EP-mismatch stale-drop.
- class/printer/printer_host.c/h: backport (still absent upstream).
- common/tusb_compiler.h: GCC-version fallthrough gate (GCC 4.8 compat).
